<!-- ============ "Quanto vale una foto?" calculator ============
     Uses Deliveroo's published figure (up to +12% online orders with photos on the menu).
     It is an estimate of gross takings, worded as "fino a" / "up to", never a promise. -->
<section id="calcolo" class="sec sec-alt" aria-labelledby="calc-title">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="head">
      <p class="eyebrow"><span lang="it">Quanto vale una foto?</span><span lang="en">What's a photo worth?</span></p>
      <h2 id="calc-title"><span lang="it">Fate due conti con i vostri numeri.</span><span lang="en">Run the numbers with your own figures.</span></h2>
      <p class="lead"><span lang="it">Bastano due dati dal pannello di Deliveroo, Glovo o Just Eat.</span><span lang="en">All you need is two figures from your Deliveroo, Glovo or Just Eat dashboard.</span></p>
    </div>
    <div class="calc" data-calc="0.12">
      <div class="calc-in">
        <div class="field">
          <div class="field-top"><label for="c-orders"><span lang="it">Ordini delivery al mese</span><span lang="en">Delivery orders per month</span></label><output data-out="orders" for="c-orders">300</output></div>
          <input id="c-orders" name="orders" type="range" min="50" max="2000" step="10" value="300">
        </div>
        <div class="field">
          <div class="field-top"><label for="c-aov"><span lang="it">Scontrino medio</span><span lang="en">Average order value</span></label><output data-out="aov" for="c-aov">25 €</output></div>
          <input id="c-aov" name="aov" type="range" min="10" max="60" step="1" value="25">
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="calc-out">
        <span class="k"><span lang="it">Stima: fino a</span><span lang="en">Estimate: up to</span></span>
        <span class="v" data-out="extra">900 €</span>
        <span class="k"><span lang="it">di incassi in più al mese, con le foto nel menù</span><span lang="en">extra takings a month, with photos on the menu</span></span>
        <p class="pay"><span lang="it">Il pacchetto Visibilità (<b data-out="vis">249 €</b>) si ripagherebbe in circa <b data-out="days">9</b> giorni.</span><span lang="en">The Visibility package (<b data-out="vis">249 €</b>) would pay for itself in about <b data-out="days">9</b> days.</span></p>
        <p class="fine"><span lang="it">Stima basata sul dato pubblicato da Deliveroo: fino al +12% di ordini online con le foto anche solo sul 10% del menù. Sono incassi lordi, non una promessa: ogni locale è diverso.</span><span lang="en">Estimate based on Deliveroo's published figure: up to +12% online orders with photos on just 10% of the menu. These are gross takings, not a promise: every restaurant is different.</span></p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

